# Third-Party Vendored Resources

This file documents the license/attribution for every third-party resource
vendored into the plugin pages. Vendored files live under `pages/dashboard/vendor/`.

## MUI (Material UI)

- Package: `@mui/material`
- Version: 9.2.0
- License: MIT
- Author: MUI (Material-UI SAS)
- Source: https://github.com/mui/material-ui
- Vendored bundle: `pages/dashboard/vendor/mui.full.js`
  - A single self-contained ESM bundle built with esbuild that inlines MUI v9
    plus its runtime dependencies (React, ReactDOM, Emotion) so the plugin page
    works fully offline with no build step and no runtime CDN access.
- MIT License text:

