## Bundled runtime dependencies (inlined into mui.full.js)

The bundle above inlines the following packages so the page works offline.
All are MIT-licensed.

| Package | Version | License | Author | Source |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| react | 19.x | MIT | Meta Platforms, Inc. | https://github.com/facebook/react |
| react-dom | 19.x | MIT | Meta Platforms, Inc. | https://github.com/facebook/react |
| @emotion/react | 11.x | MIT | Emotion team | https://github.com/emotion-js/emotion |
| @emotion/styled | 11.x | MIT | Emotion team | https://github.com/emotion-js/emotion |
| @mui/utils | 9.2.0 | MIT | MUI | https://github.com/mui/material-ui |
| @mui/system | 9.2.0 | MIT | MUI | https://github.com/mui/material-ui |
